  "route": "original",
  "notes": "Backlog game, picked from RAWG's most-added list for its year (docs/PLAN.md section 2 ordering). StrategyWiki has no separate page for the remaster (\"Red Faction Guerrilla Re-Mars-tered\" redirects to \"Red Faction: Guerrilla\"); that guide is at completion stage 0, with 25 subpages linked (sectors, Guerilla Actions, Walkthrough and more) but only \"Achievements and trophies\" and \"Table of Contents\" written, so nothing was used. redfaction.fandom.com answers the API under \"Red Faction: Guerrilla\", with about 132 linked pages, including the sectors and \"Demons of the Badlands\"; names only were looked at, nothing copied. The Steam schema calls the app \"Red Faction Guerrilla Definitive Edition\"; the store list names app 667720 \"Red Faction Guerrilla Re-Mars-tered\". None of the 57 Steam achievements is hidden. Achievements 48 to 57 (Rescue, Retribution, Redemption, Marauder Actions, Mariner Valley) form their own chapter; StrategyWiki and Fandom both list a \"Demons of the Badlands\" page, but no achievement names it, so the chapter is named after the Mariner Valley. RAWG lists a playtime of only 4 hours, which looks low."
}
